      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MULWEE JAFFA (2) goes very well over this track and trip including two wins. Was out of the placings last time (18.14) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 9 lengths. Rates a leading player. RUN ROLEX (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.25) last time in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. One of the better hopes. TRALEE AIMEE (7) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Finished third (17.59) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Will give a great sight again. JUNGLE WAY (6) jumps at a shorter distance and still warrants respect.",
